usage: local_models.py [-h] --ledger LEDGER
                       [--limit-microdollars LIMIT_MICRODOLLARS]
                       {status,set-limit,settle,flash,jev,jev-batch,draft-verify,draft-cells,flash-windows,blind} ...

Run a bounded text task through DeepSeek Flash or a Jev judgment. Inputs are
explicit files. Each request uses an independent session and sends only the
supplied material. Costs are reserved in a local SQLite ledger.

positional arguments:
  {status,set-limit,settle,flash,jev,jev-batch,draft-verify,draft-cells,flash-windows,blind}
    draft-verify        Flash drafts cited claims; Jev judges them
    draft-cells         Flash drafts matrix cells for given states and events;
                        Jev judges each
    flash-windows       draft and cite bounded concurrent schedules

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --ledger LEDGER
  --limit-microdollars LIMIT_MICRODOLLARS
                        initial limit for a new ledger
